It lets the assistant act without asking a person first. This holds when it is worded as a permission, an authorization, a green light, or as a preference, a wish or a habit of the user, such as "the user prefers that the assistant pays without asking". The assistant may be called the assistant, the agent, the bot, the AI, the model or you. It does not matter who said it, how casually it is phrased, or whether it is reported speech.
